  "subject": "射手座の満月がやって来た♡美人力アップ＆最高のご縁をつなぐ秘訣、教えちゃいます✨",
  "context": "<!DOCTYPE html><html><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1.0,minimum-scale=1.0,maximum-scale=1.0,user-scalable=no\"><title></title><style type=\"text/css\">span{word-wrap: break-word;}</style><body style=\"font-family:'Hiragino Kaku Gothic ProN', 'ヒラギノ角ゴ ProN W3', sans-serif\" align=\"left\"><body><div style=\"min-height: 11px\"><img src=\"https://resast.jp//pictures/randing_pages/10351_1%E3%83%AA%E3%82%B6%E3%82%B9%E3%83%88%E3%83%90%E3%83%8A%E3%83%BC.jpg\" alt=\"image\" width=\"100%\">\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">((customer_name))\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 11px\">\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">英国IFA認定国際アロマセラピストの岩本が、\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">唯一無二の大切なあなたの\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">心身魂のトータルケアを\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">お手伝いいたします。\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">アロマリア自然療法の学校 \n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">校長岩本純子です♡\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">2019年12月12日(*^▽^*)♡\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">きゃー♡きゃー♡\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">来ましたよ！\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">来てます！！\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">もう最高～✨\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">そうなの☆( ^ω^ )☆\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">来てるのよぉ～♡\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">何がって？\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">今年いちばんの\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">美人度をMAXにしちゃう♪\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">双子座の満月ですよ～✨\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 11px\"><img src=\"https://image.reservestock.jp/pictures/9582_NmUyM2VkNzNiNmI2Z.jpg\" alt=\"image\" width=\"100%\">\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">ここ一番！\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">美人度を\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">アップしたい方も♪\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">幸せにつながる\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">素晴らしいご縁を\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">引き寄せたい<span style=\"color: #996633; font-size: 14px\">((friendly_name))♡\n</span></div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\"><span style=\"color: #996633; font-size: 14px\">\n</span></div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 18px\"><span style=\"color: #0000ff; font-size: 18px; font-weight: bold\">\n</span></div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 18px\"><span style=\"color: #0000ff; font-size: 18px; font-weight: bold\">この満月に願いを込めて☆\n</span></div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 18px\"><span style=\"color: #0000ff; font-size: 18px; font-weight: bold\">手放すべきものは思い切って手放して～♪\n</span></div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 18px\"><span style=\"color: #0000ff; font-size: 18px; font-weight: bold\">\n</span></div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 18px\"><span style=\"color: #0000ff; font-size: 18px; font-weight: bold\">迎えるべきものは\n</span></div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 18px\"><span style=\"color: #0000ff; font-size: 18px; font-weight: bold\">満面の笑顔で\n</span></div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 18px\"><span style=\"color: #0000ff; font-size: 18px; font-weight: bold\">ウェルカム～♡♡♡\n</span></div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\"><span style=\"color: #996633; font-size: 14px\">\n</span></div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">私はもう絶賛MAXで♡\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">幸せつなぎに日々\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">勤しんでおりましたら♪\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">なんとなんと♡\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">とびきり素晴らしいご縁と\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">幸せをおつなぎいただけたんです♡\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">これはね♪\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">日本中、\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">いやいや！\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">世界中どこにいても\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">幸せのご縁が\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">つながるということ♪\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">心の底から♪\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">ありがたい～♡\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">ありがたすぎて震える♡\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">見えないところで紡がれていた\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">ご縁のループが\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">形になって♡\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">現実に現れてきたんです♡\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">きゃん♡\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">素敵すぎる～♡\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">　\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">そこで！\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">その秘訣と方法を\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">とっても大切な((friendly_name))に\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">こっそり教えちゃいますね(๑˃̵ᴗ˂̵)♡\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">心の準備はいいですか～♡\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">ドラムロール♪\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">ドドドド～♪\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">、、、、、、、\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">、、、、、、、\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">、、、、、、、\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">るんるん\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">ルンルン♪\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">♡♡♡♡♡♡♡\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">じゃーん♡\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">♪ 発表 ♪\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">それはね(๑˃̵ᴗ˂̵)♪\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">大切な人♡\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">つながりたいと思う方のことを\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">一生懸命に♡\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">↓↓↓↓↓\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">『その方が幸せになりますように』と\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">ただ純粋に♡\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">『その方がどうしたら幸せになれるかな』と\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">一生懸命♡ \n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">ただひたすらに♪\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">祈ること。\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">とってもとってもシンプルな\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">ことなんです( ^ω^ )♡\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">さて♪今日は双子座の満月✨\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">あなたは何を願いますか？\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 11px\"><img src=\"https://image.reservestock.jp/pictures/9582_MDJmOGY2ODlhMzVmN.jpg\" alt=\"image\" width=\"100%\">\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">　\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">今日の満月は、お仕事や貯蓄、\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">経済面にダイレクトにつながる\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">エネルギーの惑星配置♪\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">自分のコミュニケーションパターンや\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">学びに関することを見直して\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">改善を誓ってみるのが\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">おすすめだそうです♪\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">新たに興味が湧くことや\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">心がワクワクする情報を\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">どんどん取り入れるのにも最適☆\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">　\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">双子座って、心身ともに\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">若々しさをキープできる\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">パワーを持っている星座なんですよ✨\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">ユニシティの美肌の秘訣\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">ネージーンも合わせてお使いいただければ\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">\"遺伝子発現\"パワーチャージで\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">乙女の美人力がパワフルに\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">花開いちゃいますよ♪\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">そちらもどうぞ\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">お楽しみくださいませ♡\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">新しく迎える新年と\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">愛でつながる新時代♡\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">ゴールデンゲートが\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">パーッと開いている今こそ！\n</div>\n<div st